# This repo is public and only ever carries the published front end (the tracker
# and the Reports page), the backend, and the deploy workflow. Everything else in the working folder is
# planning notes, backtest output, or - in one case - live secrets.
#
# mirror-sync-config.json holds the deploy key, which is remote code execution
# on the backend, plus a GitHub PAT with write access to this repo. It has never
# been committed and this file is here to keep it that way, including if someone
# ever copies the whole working folder into a clone.
#
# So: ignore everything, then allow back the files that belong here.
*
!.gitignore
!Code.gs
!index.html
!reports/
!reports/index.html
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/*.yml

# Belt and braces: never, under any circumstance, the secrets file.
mirror-sync-config.json
*.pem
*.key
